{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Poolcore: Submersion",
    "steam_appid": 3294270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Submerge yourself into the rippling pools \u01b8\u0335\u0321\u04dc\u0335\u0328\u0304\u01b7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pools have been calling from your dreams, and now it\u2019s time to bathe within their tiled, chlorinated depths as you explore the liminal worlds they\u2019ve bled into. This complex yearns to be seen but should not be trusted\u2014she sees all and seeks to understand in the only way she knows how\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this navigational hazard, you\u2019ll explore surreal poolscapes, dive deep into the waters, and encounter opportunities along the way to relax and soak in the sights. The world is littered with interactive moments and cinematic vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Just don't stare too long...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/bef95292ca665d5d840a262dedf26bb7.poster.avif?t=1742484118\" width=530 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/bef95292ca665d5d840a262dedf26bb7.webm?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/bef95292ca665d5d840a262dedf26bb7.mp4?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... or the complex will start to stare back \u2022</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics \u265e\u265d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive &amp; Reactive Liminal Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world features beautifully rendered liminal spaces to explore and lose yourself within. Many environments will react to your presence and offer you an truly unmatched experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of calming bespoke music and mechanical relaxation tools offer you the opportunity to forget yourself and soak in the vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactivity, Puzzles &amp; Parkour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the complex you will encounter various objects you can pickup, throw &amp; use to solve various types of puzzles to gain access to deeper and more exotic spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swimming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deeper down into the rippling pools than ever before &amp; explore vast underwater liminality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 There is more to this experience...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/46d2eeac52035ac491a8d954c9e754b1.poster.avif?t=1742484118\" width=778 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/46d2eeac52035ac491a8d954c9e754b1.webm?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/46d2eeac52035ac491a8d954c9e754b1.mp4?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... than meets just the eye \u2022</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Liminal Spaces -`\u10e6\u00b4-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the complex, you will explore several distinct liminal spaces that will test your sanity and soothe your yearning to explore these in-between places. Each space will be draped in a poolcore aesthetic, presenting themselves in a way you\u2019ve never seen but crave more of!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Poolrooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Backrooms - Level 0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Playrooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Skypools</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 Beware of just how deep you go...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/0ff5147461c84fc19e7bd53b0d7ce468.poster.avif?t=1742484118\" width=768 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/0ff5147461c84fc19e7bd53b0d7ce468.webm?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/0ff5147461c84fc19e7bd53b0d7ce468.mp4?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... there's a possibility you won't be able to get back \u2022</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Complex Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2022 You've always been here...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/a6b4352bd519e2c3f6de01d99de985c2.poster.avif?t=1742484118\" width=782 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/a6b4352bd519e2c3f6de01d99de985c2.webm?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294270/extras/a6b4352bd519e2c3f6de01d99de985c2.mp4?t=1742484118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... this place lives between the cracks that separate your reality from your mind \u2022</i></p>",
